{
  "slug": "growthbook",
  "name": "Growthbook",
  "type": "plugin",
  "description": "A suite of agent skills for the full GrowthBook feature flag and experimentation lifecycle.",
  "longDescription": "Ships **4 skills**.\n\n- **Skills** (4): `analytics` (Chart GrowthBook product data and manage the metric catalog — run Product Analytics explorations, search metrics and fact…), `experiments` (Design, launch, analyze, and stop GrowthBook A/B tests, and search or record durable Learnings across experiments), `feature-flags` (Read and modify GrowthBook feature flags — create, search, toggle, target, schedule, ramp, monitor, publish drafts, and archive), `gb-setup` (Configure GrowthBook API credentials so the other skills can run)\n\nInstalls with `claude plugin install growthbook@claude-plugins-official` from `growthbook/skills`.",
  "compatibility": [
    "claude",
    "copilot",
